{"n": 334, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "334.webp", "text": "30 17 002\n\n32 17 033\n\n1711000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nRADIATOR\n{1988 Models)\n\n4 Cylinder M 10:\n\nUnscrew radiator cap\n\nUnscrew fan cowl.\n\nDisconnect coolant hoses and drain coolant\n(catching in clean container if applicable)\nUnscrew mounting bolts and take out radiator\nfrom above.\n\ntastailation:\n\nFill with specified coolant* + **.\n\nCaution!\n\nBe careful not to cut hands on sharp radiator\nfins,\n\n4 Cylinder M 40:\n\nUnscrew cap on integrated expansion tank of\nradiator\n\nNote:\n\nDrain plug at bottom left**,\n\n6 Cylinder M20 / M 21:\nUnscrew cap on expansion tank,\nNote;\n\nDrain plug at bottom left**\n\n* See Service Information of Gr. 00\n** See Specifications\n\nM 10\n\nPress fan cowl retainers forward with gstotted\nscrewdriver and pry ot upward\n\nPush fan cowl back\n\nAlso refer to M21\n\nPress out fan cow! plugs toward rear.\n\nM 20:\n\nUnscrew splash guard if necessary see\n5147...\n\nDrain coolant, catching if necessary.\nCoolant*\n\nDrain plug tightening torque**\n\nAlso refer to M 40.\n\nDisconnect coolant hoses.\nDetach bleeder hose.\ninstallation:\n\nMount coolant hoses**\n\nUnscrew upper radiator mounting bolts and\nlift out radiator.\n\ntnstallation:\n\nMount radiator on rubber mounts precisely.\nMount coolant hoses**\n\nFill with specified coolant* and bleed — see\n17 00 039\n\n* See Service Information of Gr. 00\n** See Specifications", "words": [["30", 0.1996, 0.2739, 0.2097, 0.2818], ["17", 0.2143, 0.2732, 0.2209, 0.2805], ["002", 0.2259, 0.2725, 0.2421, 0.2812], ["32", 0.19, 0.9708, 0.2016, 0.9814], ["17", 0.2067, 0.9708, 0.2163, 0.9808], ["033", 0.2209, 0.9702, 0.2386, 0.9808], ["1711000", 0.2644, 0.0703, 0.3131, 0.0809], ["REMOVING", 0.3267, 0.0703, 0.3865, 0.0816], ["AND", 0.3911, 0.071, 0.4144, 0.0816], ["INSTALLING", 0.4195, 0.071, 0.4863, 0.0822], ["RADIATOR", 0.3267, 0.0862, 0.385, 0.0975], ["{1988", 0.3262, 0.1028, 0.3541, 0.1147], ["Models)", 0.3576, 0.